    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realm Survivors is an action-roguelite with unique heroes, each packing signature abilities and traits. During each run, progress, unlock, swap, and mix powers across classes to craft insane builds, crush bosses, and wreck your way through the chaos plaguing the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy waves of attacking enemies;<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940930/extras/2b28396f98d7a859958d83e013e3f411.poster.avif?t=1753044791\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940930/extras/2b28396f98d7a859958d83e013e3f411.webm?t=1753044791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940930/extras/2b28396f98d7a859958d83e013e3f411.mp4?t=1753044791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new abilities to customize your character;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and play unique Characters, with more to come;<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940930/extras/7fd8c5290b2c8727c39e4397a7aae74e.poster.avif?t=1753044791\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940930/extras/7fd8c5290b2c8727c39e4397a7aae74e.webm?t=1753044791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940930/extras/7fd8c5290b2c8727c39e4397a7aae74e.mp4?t=1753044791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and make your character stronger;<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940930/extras/40747d4f8132f19318e01aefac57e062.poster.avif?t=1753044791\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940930/extras/40747d4f8132f19318e01aefac57e062.webm?t=1753044791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940930/extras/40747d4f8132f19318e01aefac57e062.mp4?t=1753044791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect money and experience;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on epic bosses to defend the realm!</p></li></ul>",
